-> ending_shell

=== ending_shell ===
The egg from the beginning reappears, tinged with today's colors.
You: I thought I was empty, but today filled me in.
You: I'm the one who breaks the shell.
The shell cracks, and a soft light spills out.
-> END

=== ending_cards ===
Shards of the day that passed settle softly in mind.
You: I'll hold onto this day.
-> END

=== ending_walk ===
Demi trots ahead a few paces, then looks back at you.
Behind you lingers the gentle warmth of Dori Village.
You: Alright, let's go.
-> END
